{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e07-scene-17",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "电视节目同质化  (Copycat Shows on Television)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wen_simo": "闻思默"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the broadcast studio, veteran host Wen Simo leads a lively discussion on why so many television singing shows look alike, comparing Xingtian's Twelve Singers with rival network ME's Supernova. Listen to Wen Simo in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "接下来这个话题，让我们聊一聊电视节目同质化的现象。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "现在各台和各网站的同质化竞争非常严重。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这导致观众不管转到哪个台，看到的都是同样的东西。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "往大了说，这其实就是原创力不足的表现。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "一档好的电视节目一经推出，如果收视率还不错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "很快就会引起大家的模仿，去追求短期的效益。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "比方说大家熟悉的十二歌王。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "歌手比赛类的节目，我平时主要就看两档。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "一档是咱们的十二歌王，另一档是对手卫视的超新星。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "可是有很多观众反映，说这两档节目放在一起看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "大家有时候都分不清楚到底哪个是哪个了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我这话要是让我们台领导听到了，我这个月的奖金又悬了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "接下来这个话题，让我们聊一聊电视节目同质化的现象。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For our next topic, let us talk about the trend of look-alike television programmes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "现在各台和各网站的同质化竞争非常严重。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right now, copycat competition across networks and streaming sites is severe.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这导致观众不管转到哪个台，看到的都是同样的东西。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As a result, whichever channel viewers flip to, they see the exact same kind of show.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "往大了说，这其实就是原创力不足的表现。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In the bigger picture, this really reflects a shortage of original creativity.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "一档好的电视节目一经推出，如果收视率还不错。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Whenever a strong television programme launches and earns decent ratings.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "很快就会引起大家的模仿，去追求短期的效益。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It quickly sparks a wave of imitators chasing short-term gains.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "比方说大家熟悉的十二歌王。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Take, for instance, the familiar hit show Twelve Singers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "歌手比赛类的节目，我平时主要就看两档。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Among singer competition shows, I normally watch just two.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "一档是咱们的十二歌王，另一档是对手卫视的超新星。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'One is our Twelve Singers, and the other is the rival network's Supernova.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "可是有很多观众反映，说这两档节目放在一起看。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yet many viewers have told us that when watching these two shows side by side.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "大家有时候都分不清楚到底哪个是哪个了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'At times people can barely tell which programme is which anymore.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我这话要是让我们台领导听到了，我这个月的奖金又悬了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If our network bosses overhear me saying that, my bonus this month is in jeopardy again!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "接下来这个话题，让我们聊一聊电视节目同质化的现象。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "现在各台和各网站的同质化竞争非常严重。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "这导致观众不管转到哪个台，看到的都是同样的东西。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "往大了说，这其实就是原创力不足的表现。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "一档好的电视节目一经推出，如果收视率还不错。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "很快就会引起大家的模仿，去追求短期的效益。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "比方说大家熟悉的十二歌王。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "歌手比赛类的节目，我平时主要就看两档。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "一档是咱们的十二歌王，另一档是对手卫视的超新星。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "可是有很多观众反映，说这两档节目放在一起看。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "大家有时候都分不清楚到底哪个是哪个了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "我这话要是让我们台领导听到了，我这个月的奖金又悬了！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Wen Simo's candid remark hits home back at Xingtian, reminding Unit One that Twelve Singers must keep innovating to stay ahead. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wen_simo",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
